# CLI / wizard → documentation

**Phase:** implementation (see [agent-phases.md](../../docs/sdlc/agent-phases.md)).

When editing matched paths:

1. [README.md](../../README.md) — commands, flags, examples.
2. [user-experience.md](../../docs/specs/dependency-engine/user-experience.md) if wizard/dependency UX behavior changes.
3. If shipping a task: remove from [active.md](../../docs/roadmap/active.md); [changelog.md](../../docs/history/changelog.md).
4. **`/sync-documentation`** before PR.

Planning-only UX design (no code): update UX spec + roadmap; do not changelog.
